  "id": "epistemic-value",
  "term": "epistemic value",
  "definition": "Epistemic value is the extent to which a learning activity is seen as worthwhile for gaining knowledge or making visible learning progress. In this study, it refers to learners’ sense that practicing with AI is not just interactive, but genuinely useful for learning.",
